# mutgap_svc_unmap_before_objlist: An UnmapMemory (34) of the page just before the object list's, which ends exactly where the list starts, after the guest moved the list page's leaf to another guest page holding a different list. The unmap does not touch the list (the overlap test is strict), so in the memory-map setups the list stays mapped over its old guest page and reference 2, made after the move, is the old list's buffer at page 10. In the blocks setup the list is read through the host task's mapping, which the guest's leaf does not change either. The service keeps its own mapping likewise.
